{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/光耀•骁勇突进","pageid":9223,"revid":22510,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%89%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%AA%81%E5%8B%87%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%89%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%AA%81%E5%8B%87%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%89%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%AA%81%E5%8B%87%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>光耀•骁勇突进</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.85.89.E8.80.80.E2.80.A2.E9.AA.81.E5.8B.87.E7.AA.81.E8.BF.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"光耀•骁勇突进\"><b>光耀•骁勇突进</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 光耀•骁勇突进.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/645jc33mfmlbt86ye4eqv8ktkti3iyf.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%89%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%AA%81%E5%8B%87%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/645jc33mfmlbt86ye4eqv8ktkti3iyf.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%89%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E9%AA%81%E5%8B%87%E7%AA%81%E8%BF%9B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/71/645jc33mfmlbt86ye4eqv8ktkti3iyf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />光耀•骁勇突进\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-6十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3*6\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，选择自身十字范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内任一地形格，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"精准冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">精准冲锋</font></span></span>]（可穿透，自身受到碰撞伤害降低100%），对路径及其两侧敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>伤害，击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格（朝冲锋方向）。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]后，移动力增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格（持续至行动结束），并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-6十字 3*6.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/edpfomi91pe5k3yh1wa828pttqnv1l8.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-6%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A6.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/edpfomi91pe5k3yh1wa828pttqnv1l8.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-6%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A6.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/edpfomi91pe5k3yh1wa828pttqnv1l8.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-6%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3%2A6.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"194\" data-file-height=\"197\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"角色图鉴库/列奥尼德\"><img alt